{
  "info": {
    "name": "SamvadX x SkyCRM-ACD",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Every SkyCRM-ACD API from spec v1.2 and the SamvadX spec (predictive dialling), numbered as in the spec (S).\n\nFill the **SkyCRM** environment first (secret, extension). Each request mints its own HS256 token, the same way SamvadX's server does. Bodies are form-encoded, except disposition_api and users_webhook_api (JSON).\n\n## S21 Events SkyCRM sends to us (webhook)\nSkyCRM posts these to SamvadX's webhook. Postman doesn't send them; they're here for reference.\n\n| Event | status | Key fields |\n|---|---|---|\n| Incoming call | `Incomming Call` | phone, direction, source, destination, queue, callid |\n| Inbound answered | `Answered` | + extension of the agent who answered |\n| Outbound call | `Outbound Call` | phone, direction, callid, extension |\n| Outbound answered | `Answered` | phone, callid, extension |\n| CDR created | (no status) | callid, src, dst, start, end, billsec, disposition, direction, recordfile |\n| IVR keypress | event `ivrdtmf` | ivr, caller, dtmf, callid |\n"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Mints the SkyCRM token (HS256 JWT) before every request, exactly as SamvadX's server does.",
          "const secret = pm.environment.get(\"secret\");",
          "if (!secret) throw new Error(\"Set 'secret' in the SkyCRM environment first.\");",
          "const b64url = (words) =>",
          "  CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(words).replace(/=+$/, \"\").replace(/\\+/g, \"-\").replace(/\\//g, \"_\");",
          "const part = (obj) => b64url(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify(obj)));",
          "const header = part({ alg: \"HS256\", typ: \"JWT\" });",
          "const payload = part({",
          "  username: pm.environment.get(\"username\") || \"\",",
          "  password: pm.environment.get(\"password\") || \"\",",
          "  extension: pm.variables.get(\"token_extension\") || pm.environment.get(\"extension\"),",
          "  exp: Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) + 3600,",
          "});",
          "const signature = b64url(CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(header + \".\" + payload, secret));",
          "pm.variables.set(\"token\", header + \".\" + payload + \".\" + signature);"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// SkyCRM answers HTTP 200 even on failure: the body's \"status\" is the real result.",
          "let body = {};",
          "try { body = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
          "if (body && body.status !== undefined) {",
          "  pm.test(\"SkyCRM status is a success\", () => {",
          "    pm.expect(String(body.status).toLowerCase()).to.be.oneOf([\"200\", \"success\", \"user logout\"]);",
          "  });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Login and logout",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "S22 Login (login_user_ajax2)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login_user_ajax2?token={{token}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login_user_ajax2"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Checks the token. Success redirects to the SkyCRM home page; 401 = expired/invalid token, 404 = user not available."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "S25 Logout (logout2)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{username}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout2",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout2"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
